  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "en-US",
    "key": "talent.1129.description",
    "text": "Replaces <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> with <linktext=1547><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Double Arrow</style></linktext> and enhances the ability to use this skill.<br>Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> per second.<br>Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> CD decrease to <linktext=1547><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Double Arrow</style></linktext>.<br>You can tame a <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> to assist you in battle.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> always follows the caster. When the caster deals DMG with Class Skills, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">23%</style> chance to swiftly strike the target (guaranteed on Crit), dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK to the enemy (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>). Additionally, when the strike count of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>, the next strike of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> combines all excess strikes and DMG.<br><br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>The Falcon responds to the caster's attacks. Haste and Crit increase its strike frequency, and after learning Lightning Strike, the Falcon deals significantly more DMG.</size></style></i>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1165359300",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
